<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Inishtech official listing cancelled - Irish S.E.</title>
<headline>Inishtech official listing cancelled - Irish S.E.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Irish Stock Exchange said on Thursday that the stock exchange listing for Inishtech Plc has been cancelled with effect from 0930 GMT.  </p>
<p>Industrial holding group James Crean Plc bought out the minority of shares it did not already own in Inistech in April.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
